    "summary": "The KJV of Ecclesiastes 2:12 asks “what can the man do that cometh after the king?”. Brenton’s Greek asks who the man is “who will follow after counsel”, with a Greek word that Brenton’s English renders “counsel” where the KJV has “the king”.",
