    "reasoning": "The KJV’s question is about the man who comes after “the king”. The Greek question is about the man who comes after “counsel”; the Greek word printed there is not the word Brenton’s English renders “king” anywhere in the verse. The two verses also open the question differently (“what can the man do” and “who is the man”).",
