    "text": "KJV Ecclesiastes 8:1: “Who is as the wise man? and who knoweth the interpretation of a thing? a man's wisdom maketh his face to shine, and the boldness of his face shall be changed.” Hebrew (WLC) 8:1: וְעֹ֥ז פָּנָ֖יו יְשֻׁנֶּֽא. Brenton’s Greek 8:1: ἀναιδὴς προσώπῳ αὐτοῦ μισηθήσεται. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/ECC08.htm) prints: “a man of shameless countenance will be hated”. Brenton’s Greek 8:1 begins Σοφία ἀνθρώπου φωτιεῖ πρόσωπον αὐτοῦ. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/21/8/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/ECC08.htm.",
