    "text": "KJV Ecclesiastes 8:10: “And so I saw the wicked buried, who had come and gone from the place of the holy, and they were forgotten in the city where they had so done: this is also vanity.” Hebrew (WLC) 8:10: וְיִֽשְׁתַּכְּח֥וּ בָעִ֖יר אֲשֶׁ֣ר כֵּן־עָשׂ֑וּ. Brenton’s Greek 8:10: ἐπῃνέθησαν ἐν τῇ πόλει, ὅτι οὕτως ἐποίησαν. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/ECC08.htm) prints: “were praised in the city, because they had done thus”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/21/8/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/ECC08.htm.",
