    "text": "KJV Ecclesiastes 10:11: “Surely the serpent will bite without enchantment; and a babbler is no better.” Hebrew (WLC) 10:11: וְאֵ֣ין יִתְרֹ֔ון לְבַ֖עַל הַלָּשֹֽׁון. Brenton’s Greek 10:11: καὶ οὐκ ἔστι περίσσεια τῷ ἐπᾴδοντι. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/ECC10.htm) prints: “then there is no advantage to the charmer”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/21/10/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/ECC10.htm.",
