    "text": "KJV Song of Solomon 6:7: “As a piece of a pomegranate are thy temples within thy locks.” Hebrew (WLC) 6:7: רַקָּתֵ֔ךְ מִבַּ֖עַד לְצַמָּתֵֽךְ. Brenton’s Greek 6:7: μῆλόν σου ἐκτὸς τῆς σιωπήσεώς σου. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/SNG06.htm) prints: “being seen without thy veil”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/22/6/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/SNG06.htm.",
