    "summary": "The KJV of Jeremiah 31:22 says “the Lord hath created a new thing in the earth, A woman shall compass a man”. Brenton’s Greek prints words that Brenton’s English renders “the Lord has created safety for a new plantation: men shall go about in safety”.",
    "text": "KJV Jeremiah 31:22: “the Lord hath created a new thing in the earth, A woman shall compass a man”. Hebrew (WLC) 31:22: בָרָ֨א יְהוָ֤ה חֲדָשָׁה֙ בָּאָ֔רֶץ נְקֵבָ֖ה תְּסֹ֥ובֵֽב גָּֽבֶר. Brenton’s Greek 38:22: ἔκτισε Κύριος σωτηρίαν εἰς καταφύτευσιν καινὴν, ἐν σωτηρίᾳ περιελεύσονται ἄνθρωποι. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/JER38.htm) prints: “the Lord has created safety for a new plantation: men shall go about in safety”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/24/31/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/JER38.htm.",
