    "text": "KJV Hosea 4:18: “Their drink is sour”. Hebrew (WLC) 4:18: סָ֖ר סָבְאָ֑ם. Brenton’s Greek 4:18: ἠρέτισε Χαναναίους. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/HOS04.htm) prints: “He has chosen the Chananites”. KJV Hosea 12:7: “He is a merchant”. Hebrew (WLC) 12:8: כְּנַ֗עַן. Brenton’s Greek 12:8: Χαναὰν. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/HOS12.htm) prints: “As for Chanaan”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/28/4/, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/28/12/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/HOS04.htm and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/HOS12.htm.",
