    "text": "KJV Daniel 6:18: “neither were instruments of musick brought before him”. Aramaic (WLC) 6:19: וְדַחֲוָ֖ן לָא־הַנְעֵ֣ל קָֽדָמֹ֑והִי. Brenton’s Greek 6:19: ἐδέσματα οὐκ εἰσήνεγκαν αὐτῷ. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/DAG06.htm) prints: “they brought him no food”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/27/6/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/DAG06.htm.",
