    "text": "KJV Daniel 8:14: “Unto two thousand and three hundred days”. Hebrew (WLC) 8:14: עַ֚ד עֶ֣רֶב בֹּ֔קֶר אַלְפַּ֖יִם וּשְׁלֹ֣שׁ מֵאֹ֑ות. Brenton’s Greek 8:14: ἕως ἑσπέρας καὶ πρωῒ ἡμέραι δισχίλιαι καὶ τετρακόσιαι. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/DAG08.htm) prints: “Evening and morning there shall be two thousand and four hundred days”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/27/8/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/DAG08.htm.",
