    "text": "KJV Daniel 3:1: “Nebuchadnezzar the king made an image of gold”. Aramaic (WLC) 3:1: נְבוּכַדְנֶצַּ֣ר מַלְכָּ֗א עֲבַד֙ צְלֵ֣ם דִּֽי־דְהַ֔ב. Brenton’s Greek 3:1: Ἔτους ὀκτωκαιδεκάτου Ναβουχοδονόσορ ὁ βασιλεὺς ἐποίησεν εἰκόνα χρυσῆν. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/DAG03.htm) prints: “In his eighteenth year Nabuchodonosor the king made a golden image”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/27/3/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/DAG03.htm.",
