    "text": "KJV Joel 3:18: “shall water the valley of Shittim”. Hebrew (WLC) 4:18: וְהִשְׁקָ֖ה אֶת־נַ֥חַל הַשִּׁטִּֽים. Brenton’s Greek 4:18: καὶ ποτιεῖ τὸν χειμάῤῥουν τῶν σχοίνων. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/JOL04.htm) prints: “and water the valley of flags”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/29/4/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/JOL04.htm.",
