    "text": "KJV Amos 3:11: “An adversary there shall be even round about the land”. Hebrew (WLC) 3:11: צַ֖ר וּסְבִ֣יב הָאָ֑רֶץ. Brenton’s Greek 3:11: Τύρος κυκλόθεν ἡ γῆ σου ἐρημωθήσεται. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/AMO03.htm) prints: “O Tyre, thy land shall be made desolate round about thee”. KJV Amos 1:9: “For three transgressions of Tyrus”. Hebrew (WLC) 1:9: צֹ֔ר. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/30/3/, https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/30/1/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/AMO03.htm.",
