    "text": "KJV Amos 6:1: “Woe to them that are at ease in Zion”. Hebrew (WLC) 6:1: הֹ֚וי הַשַּׁאֲנַנִּ֣ים בְּצִיֹּ֔ון. Brenton’s Greek 6:1: Οὐαὶ τοῖς ἐξουθενοῦσι Σιὼν. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/AMO06.htm) prints: “Woe to them that set at nought Sion”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/30/6/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/AMO06.htm.",
