    "text": "KJV Amos 9:1: “Smite the lintel of the door, that the posts may shake”. Hebrew (WLC) 9:1: הַ֨ךְ הַכַּפְתֹּ֜ור וְיִרְעֲשׁ֣וּ הַסִּפִּ֗ים. Brenton’s Greek 9:1: Πάταξον ἐπὶ τὸ ἱλαστήριον, καὶ σεισθήσεται τὰ πρόπυλα. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/AMO09.htm) prints: “Smite the mercy-seat, and the porch shall be shaken”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/30/9/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/AMO09.htm.",
