    "text": "KJV Amos 9:7: “the Philistines from Caphtor, and the Syrians from Kir”. Hebrew (WLC) 9:7: וּפְלִשְׁתִּיִּ֥ים מִכַּפְתֹּ֖ור וַאֲרָ֥ם מִקִּֽיר. Brenton’s Greek 9:7: τοὺς ἀλλοφύλους ἐκ Καππαδοκίας, καὶ τοὺς Σύρους ἐκ βόθρου. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/AMO09.htm) prints: “the Philistines from Cappadocia, and the Syrians out of the deep”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/30/9/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/AMO09.htm.",
