    "reasoning": "The Hebrew quoted prints למען יירשו את שארית אדום. The KJV has them “possess” the remnant of Edom. The Greek has the remnant of men seeking, with ἀνθρώπων, “of men”, where the KJV has the name Edom, and a verb of seeking where the KJV has a verb of possessing. The Greek of Acts 15:17 prints the same phrase and verb as Brenton’s Greek of Amos.",
