    "text": "KJV Joel 2:28: “it shall come to pass afterward, that I will pour out my spirit upon all flesh”. Hebrew (WLC) 3:1: וְהָיָ֣ה אַֽחֲרֵי־כֵ֗ן. Brenton’s Greek 3:1: Καὶ ἔσται μετὰ ταῦτα. KJV Acts 2:17: “it shall come to pass in the last days, saith God, I will pour out of my Spirit upon all flesh”. Greek New Testament Acts 2:17 (Tischendorf, eighth edition): ἐν ταῖς ἐσχάταις ἡμέραις. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/29/3/, https://ebible.org/grcbrent/JOL03.htm, https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/44/2/ and https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/44/2/.",
