    "status": "Context",
    "summary": "The KJV of Zechariah 6:13 has the Branch “be a priest upon his throne”. Brenton’s Greek prints ἱερεὺς ἐκ δεξιῶν αὐτοῦ, which Brenton’s own English renders “a priest on his right hand”.",
    "text": "KJV Zechariah 6:13: “and he shall be a priest upon his throne”. Hebrew (WLC) 6:13: וְהָיָ֤ה כֹהֵן֙ עַל־כִּסְאֹ֔ו. Brenton’s Greek 6:13: καὶ ἔσται ἱερεὺς ἐκ δεξιῶν αὐτοῦ. Brenton’s own English (https://ebible.org/eng-Brenton/ZEC06.htm) prints: “and there shall be a priest on his right hand”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/38/6/ and https://ebible.org/grcbrent/ZEC06.htm.",
    "reasoning": "The Hebrew quoted prints והיה כהן על כסאו. In the KJV the priest is upon the throne. In the Greek the priest is at the right hand of the one who sits and rules upon the throne. Upon the throne and at the right hand are different places for the priest to be.",
