    "text": "KJV Matthew 4:5: “the devil taketh him up into the holy city, and setteth him on a pinnacle of the temple”. KJV Matthew 4:8: “the devil taketh him up into an exceeding high mountain”. KJV Luke 4:5: “the devil, taking him up into an high mountain, shewed unto him all the kingdoms of the world”. KJV Luke 4:9: “he brought him to Jerusalem, and set him on a pinnacle of the temple”.",
