    "text": "KJV Mark 12:29: “The first of all the commandments is”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Mark 12:29: ὅτι πρώτη ἐστίν· ἄκουε Ἰσραήλ [that the first is: Hear, O Israel]. Greek New Testament (Textus Receptus as served, printed there without accents) Mark 12:29: οτι πρωτη πασων των εντολων ακουε ισραηλ [that the first of all the commandments is: Hear, O Israel]. KJV Mark 12:30: “with all thy strength: this is the first commandment”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Mark 12:30: καὶ ἐξ ὅλης τῆς ἰσχύος σου [and with all your strength — the verse ends here]. Greek New Testament (Textus Receptus as served, printed there without accents) Mark 12:30: και εξ ολης της ισχυος σου αυτη πρωτη εντολη [and with all your strength. This is the first commandment]. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/41/12/ and https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/41/12/.",
