    "summary": "In the KJV of Mark 14:12 the disciples prepare the passover on “the first day of unleavened bread, when they killed the passover”, and Jesus eats it with them that night. In the KJV of John 18:28, on the morning of the judgment, the Jews will not enter the judgment hall “lest they should be defiled; but that they might eat the passover”.",
