    "text": "KJV Mark 3:18: “and Thaddaeus”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Mark 3:18: καὶ Θαδδαῖον. KJV Luke 6:16: “Judas the brother of James”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Luke 6:16: Ἰούδαν Ἰακώβου. KJV Matthew 10:3: “Lebbaeus, whose surname was Thaddaeus”. KJV John 14:22: “Judas saith unto him, not Iscariot”. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/41/3/, https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/41/3/, https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/42/6/ and https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/42/6/.",
