    "summary": "The KJV of Matthew 14:5 says that Herod “would have put him to death” but feared the multitude. The KJV of Mark 6:19–20 says that Herodias “would have killed him; but she could not: for Herod feared John, knowing that he was a just man and an holy, and observed him”.",
