    "status": "Context",
    "summary": "The KJV of John 20:25 has Thomas say he will not believe “Except I shall see in his hands the print of the nails, and put my finger into the print of the nails”. The Textus Receptus text served prints τὸν τύπον τῶν ἥλων (the print of the nails) both times; Tischendorf’s text prints τὸν τύπον for the first and εἰς τὸν τόπον τῶν ἥλων (into the place of the nails) for the second.",
