    "summary": "The KJV of Acts 9:27 has Barnabas take Saul and bring “him to the apostles”, and 9:28 has him “with them coming in and going out at Jerusalem”. In Galatians 1:18–19 Paul writes that he went up to Jerusalem to see Peter and stayed fifteen days, and that “other of the apostles saw I none, save James the Lord’s brother”.",
