    "text": "KJV Luke 1:6: “they were both righteous before God”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Luke 1:6: ἦσαν δὲ δίκαιοι ἀμφότεροι. KJV Romans 3:10: “There is none righteous, no, not one”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Romans 3:10: οὐκ ἔστιν δίκαιος οὐδὲ εἷς. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/42/1/, https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/42/1/, https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/45/3/ and https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/45/3/.",
