    "text": "KJV Leviticus 11:8: “Of their flesh shall ye not eat” … “they are unclean to you”. Hebrew, Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) digital text, Leviticus 11:8: מִבְּשָׂרָם֙ לֹ֣א תֹאכֵ֔לוּ … טְמֵאִ֥ים הֵ֖ם לָכֶֽם. KJV Romans 14:14: “there is nothing unclean of itself”. Greek New Testament (Tischendorf, eighth edition) Romans 14:14: οὐδὲν κοινὸν. Fetched from https://bolls.life/get-text/WLC/3/11/, https://bolls.life/get-text/TISCH/45/14/ and https://bolls.life/get-text/TR/45/14/.",
